From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mpc823 <11076149+mpc823@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] core: open main menu independent of channel mode

RC_setup (KEY_MENU) was handled only inside the TV/radio mode branch. On a
PC without a channel source the core can remain in another mode, so the key
was accepted but no menu was shown. Handle the common main-menu action before
mode-specific dispatch while retaining the existing minimode policy.
---
 src/neutrino.cpp | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/neutrino.cpp b/src/neutrino.cpp
index 0000000..1111111 100644
--- a/src/neutrino.cpp
+++ b/src/neutrino.cpp
@@ -2689,0 +2690,5 @@ void CNeutrinoApp::RealRun()
+		if (msg == CRCInput::RC_setup && !g_settings.minimode) {
+			showMainMenu();
+			continue;
+		}
+
